    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But a coda is just a way to delay the silence, isn't it? The problem isn't just the music. It's the decay that comes after. The memory loss, the shaking hands, the loss of the very faculties that allowed me to reach this peak. It feels more dignified to leave while the light is still bright, rather than waiting for the lamp to flicker and die out in the dark.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
